{"title": "Key Wielding Nutcracker", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Key Wielding Nutcracker</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Key Wielding Nutcracker.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg/250px-Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg?d46b8b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg/375px-Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg?d46b8b 1.5x, /images/thumb/Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg/500px-Key_Wielding_Nutcracker.jpg?d46b8b 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nNutcracker</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nNutcrackerKey</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n10</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nGunshots, Kicking</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\n5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\n20, 40, 100, or Instant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.5</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Key Wielding Nutcracker</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Nutcracker\">Nutcracker</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. As its name implies, it looks very similar to the Nutcracker except it has a brighter colored coat, a hollowed out eye, and a key around its neck.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Key Wielding Nutcracker</b> behaves identical to the Nutcracker, having the same patrolling state, scanning state, attacking state, etc. The most notable differences are the bloody visual effects that comes out after the shotgun is fired and the scrap dropped, being the <b>Bloody shotgun</b>, up to two <b>Bloody Ammo</b>, and the <b>Toy vault key</b>. The first two are functionally identical to the <b>Shotgun</b> and <b>Ammo</b> respectively, and the ammo works for reloading any shotgun, but killing a <b>Key Wielding Nutcracker</b> is the only legitimate way to obtain any of this scrap.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Conditions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Conditions\">&gt; Spawn Conditions</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Key Wielding Nutcracker</b> will almost immediately spawn in the interior if the <a href=\"/wiki/Toy_Store#Kill_the_Key_Keeper\" title=\"Toy Store\"><b>Kill the Key Keeper</b></a> objective is generated in the <b>Toy Store</b>. This spawn does not contribute to total Power Level, and the Max Count and Power Level of the <b>Key Wielding Nutcracker</b> only matter if players modify spawn tables to spawn the <b>Key Wielding Nutcracker</b> elsewhere.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Key wielding nutcracker <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Key wielding nutcracker<br /><br />[No information about this entity was found.]\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alert Music</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"6\" data-mwtitle=\"NutcrackerAngry.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/NutcrackerAngry.mp3?17d56e\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/NutcrackerAngry.mp3/NutcrackerAngry.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stomping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"BootStomp1.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BootStomp1.mp3?62cb8c\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/BootStomp1.mp3/BootStomp1.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"BootStomp2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/BootStomp2.mp3?ba1c4f\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=